      "description": "The generic pipeline slots this layer fills, one `folio-pipeline-plugin/v1` node per slot, naming `PIPELINE_IMPLEMENTATIONS` in `pipeline/plugin-slots.ts`, registered for a folio through its dependency tree by `loadContributions`. Two: `tabular-csvw`, through which cat-harness-tools' `ingest-document.ts` reaches this layer's CSVW extractors (`scripts/tabular-csv.ts`, `scripts/tabular-xlsx.ts`) without naming this layer, and `library-entry-arms`, through which it runs this layer's reference-list and glossary readers (`scripts/references-extract.ts`, `scripts/glossary-from-source.ts`) over each promoted library entry and records each one's step in the entry's `extraction.json`.",
